{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56521","headline":"巨胜歌（幷序） 十 · 柳冲用","name":"巨胜歌（幷序） 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太元道士本神仙，移名中都学自然。\n世人链药迷金水，烧尽黄芽不识铅。\n西蜀水银人竞采，得火须臾变作烟。\n若能得一莫执一妙法玄之又更玄。\n（《正统道藏》如字号。\n）（〖1〗《崇文总目》卷四道书类七着录：「《巨胜歌》一卷。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳冲用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56521.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56521","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}